            "eyebrow": "GKU Policy",
            "title": "Shipping Policy",
            "policy_content": "<p>Find everything you need to know about <strong>GKU shipping and delivery</strong>, including order processing times, shipping costs, estimated delivery times, supported destinations, order tracking, customs, taxes, and delivery support.</p><h2>1. Order Processing Time</h2><p>Most GKU orders are processed within <strong>1–2 business days</strong> after payment has been successfully confirmed.</p><p>Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will normally be processed on the next business day.</p><p>Processing may take longer during:</p><ul><li>Major promotional events or holiday periods</li><li>New product launches</li><li>Periods of unusually high order volume</li><li>Inventory transfers between warehouses</li><li>Address or payment verification</li></ul><p>Once your order has shipped, you will receive a shipping confirmation email containing your tracking information.</p><p><strong>Order processing time is separate from the estimated shipping time.</strong></p>",
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "content_max_width": 1300,
