        "ai_gen_block_d149a36_qiiDEK": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_d149a36",
          "name": "Refund policy content",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "",
            "title": "",
            "policy_content": "<h2>4. Where Does GKU Ship?</h2><p>GKU ships to supported countries and regions worldwide, subject to product availability, local delivery services, and checkout eligibility.</p><p>Shipping availability may vary by product. The most accurate way to confirm whether we can ship a specific GKU product to your address is to enter your delivery information during checkout.</p><p>Orders may be fulfilled from different warehouses depending on your destination and available inventory.</p><h2>5. Local Warehouse Fulfillment</h2><p>Whenever possible, GKU may fulfill orders from a local or regional warehouse to provide faster and more efficient delivery.</p><p>Warehouse selection is determined automatically based on factors including:</p><ul><li>Delivery destination</li><li>Product availability</li><li>Inventory levels</li><li>Logistics capacity</li><li>Shipping method</li></ul><p>Customers generally cannot manually select a fulfillment warehouse.</p><p>If the product you ordered is unavailable at the nearest warehouse, GKU may arrange fulfillment from another available warehouse or shipping origin. This may result in a longer delivery time.</p><h2>6. International Shipping, Customs & Import Duties</h2><p>International orders may be subject to customs procedures, import duties, taxes, or other charges depending on the destination country or region.</p><p>Where <strong>DDP (Delivered Duty Paid)</strong> shipping is available and selected or included for an eligible order, applicable import duties and taxes are generally handled as part of the shipping arrangement.</p><p>Where DDP is not available, the recipient may be responsible for applicable customs duties, import taxes, clearance fees, or other charges required by local authorities.</p><p>DDP availability may vary depending on the destination, product, shipping method, and current logistics services.</p><p>Any applicable charges or shipping options presented at checkout should be reviewed before completing your purchase.</p><h2>7. Southeast Asia Shipping</h2><p>GKU supports delivery to selected Southeast Asian markets where logistics services are available.</p><p>Depending on the destination and product, shipping may be available to markets such as:</p><ul><li>Singapore</li><li>Malaysia</li><li>Thailand</li><li>Indonesia</li><li>Philippines</li><li>Vietnam</li></ul><p>Available shipping methods, delivery times, and DDP availability may vary by destination and are subject to the options displayed at checkout.</p><p>If your country or region is not currently available for a specific product, please contact GKU Support before placing your order.</p><h2>8. Estimated Delivery Times</h2><p>Estimated delivery times begin <strong>after your order has been processed and shipped</strong>.</p><p>Typical delivery estimates are:</p><p><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> 3–7 business days<br/><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> 5–10 business days</p><p>These timeframes are estimates rather than guaranteed delivery dates.</p><p>Delivery may be affected by factors outside GKU's reasonable control, including:</p><ul><li>Customs inspections</li><li>Severe weather</li><li>Carrier disruptions</li><li>Public holidays</li><li>Peak shopping seasons</li><li>Remote delivery locations</li><li>Incorrect or incomplete delivery information</li><li>International logistics disruptions</li></ul><h2>9. Order Tracking</h2><p>Once your order has shipped, GKU will send a shipping confirmation email with available tracking information.</p><p>Tracking information may take some time to become active after the carrier receives the shipment.</p><p>If your tracking information has not updated for several business days, please contact GKU Support and provide:</p><ul><li>Your order number</li><li>Your name</li><li>Your tracking number</li></ul><p>Our support team will help review the shipment status where possible.</p><h2>10. Incorrect or Incomplete Shipping Address</h2><p>Customers are responsible for providing a complete and accurate shipping address when placing an order.</p><p>Please carefully check your:</p><ul><li>Recipient name</li><li>Street address</li><li>Apartment or unit number</li><li>City</li><li>State or province</li><li>Postal or ZIP code</li><li>Country</li><li>Telephone number</li></ul><p>If you notice an error after placing your order, contact GKU Support as soon as possible.</p><p>We cannot guarantee that an address can be changed after an order has entered processing or has already shipped.</p><p>If a shipment is returned because of an incorrect, incomplete, or undeliverable address provided by the customer, additional shipping charges may apply before the order can be shipped again.</p><h2>11. Delayed Shipments</h2><p>Carrier delays may occasionally occur because of weather, customs inspections, peak periods, transportation disruptions, or other circumstances outside our reasonable control.</p><p>If your tracking information has not updated for several business days or your order is significantly beyond the estimated delivery window, please contact GKU Support.</p><p>We will review the available tracking information and, where appropriate, assist with a carrier inquiry.</p><h2>12. Tracking Shows Delivered, but I Cannot Find My Package</h2><p>If tracking shows that your package has been delivered but you cannot locate it, please first:</p><ol><li>Check around the delivery location, including entrances, mailrooms, reception areas, garages, and other safe locations.</li><li>Ask household members, neighbors, building staff, or reception personnel whether they accepted the package.</li><li>Check the tracking information for delivery notes or proof of delivery.</li><li>Contact the carrier for additional delivery details.</li></ol><p>Carriers may occasionally mark a shipment as delivered shortly before the final delivery is completed.</p><p>If the package is still missing after <strong>24 hours</strong>, contact GKU Support with your order number and tracking number. We will review the available delivery information and assist with a carrier inquiry where appropriate.</p><h2>13. Lost Packages</h2><p>If a shipment appears to have been lost in transit, please contact GKU Support.</p><p>We will review the tracking information and may open an investigation with the shipping carrier.</p><p>Depending on the circumstances and investigation results, GKU will provide an appropriate resolution in accordance with applicable policies and consumer protection laws.</p><h2>14. Damaged Packages</h2><p>If your order arrives damaged, please contact GKU Support as soon as reasonably possible.</p><p>To help us review the issue, please provide:</p><ul><li>Your order number</li><li>Photos of the outer shipping package</li><li>Photos of the shipping label</li><li>Photos or video showing the damaged product</li><li>A brief description of the damage</li></ul><p>Please keep the original packaging until the case has been reviewed.</p><p>Our support team will provide the appropriate next steps based on the circumstances.</p><h2>15. Split Shipments</h2><p>Orders containing multiple products may occasionally be shipped separately because items are stored in different warehouses or require different logistics arrangements.</p><p>If your order is divided into multiple shipments, you may receive separate tracking numbers.</p><p>Receiving one package does not necessarily mean that the remaining items in your order are missing.</p><h2>16. Order Changes & Cancellations</h2><p>If you need to change or cancel an order, please contact GKU Support as soon as possible.</p><p>We will try to accommodate your request if the order has not yet been processed or shipped.</p><p>Once an order has entered fulfillment or has been handed to the carrier, we may be unable to change the shipping address or cancel the shipment.</p><p>If you no longer need the product after it has shipped, please refer to the <strong>GKU Return & Refund Policy</strong> after delivery.</p><h2>17. Shipping Restrictions</h2><p>Certain products, destinations, remote areas, or address types may be subject to shipping restrictions.</p><p>Available shipping services may also change depending on carrier availability, customs regulations, inventory, or other logistics conditions.</p><p>If no shipping option appears at checkout for your address, please contact GKU Support for assistance.</p><h2>18. Contact GKU Support</h2><p>If you have questions about shipping, tracking, delivery times, or an existing order, please contact:</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> support@gkutech.com<br/><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +86 147 7631 5502<br/><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Monday–Friday, 9:30 –22:00  (BJT / UTC+8)</p><p>When contacting us about an existing order, please include your <strong>order number</strong> so we can assist you more efficiently.</p>",
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "content_max_width": 1400,
            "heading_size": 48,
            "body_size": 14,
